{"ticker":"CDW","updated":"2026-10-30T22:39:26Z","profile":{"longName":"CDW Corporation","shortName":"CDW Corporation","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cdw.com","fullTimeEmployees":14800,"marketCap":19226429440,"trailingPE":18.484375,"forwardPE":12.7472,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.818132,"pegRatio":1.33,"targetMeanPrice":159.11111,"targetHighPrice":171.0,"targetLowPrice":148.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":9,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.1,"earningsGrowth":0.049,"grossMargins":0.21360001,"operatingMargins":0.07345,"profitMargins":0.04597,"totalRevenue":23500400640,"beta":0.941,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":166.15,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":97.12,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.53},"summary":"CDW Corporation provides information technology (IT) solutions in the United States, the United Kingdom, and Canada. It operates through three segments: Commercial, Government, and Education. The company offers discrete hardware and software products and services, as well as integrated IT solutions, including on-premise and cloud capabilities across hybrid infrastructure, digital experience, and security. It also provides hardware products comprising notebooks/mobile devices, tablets, network communications, collaboration hardware, data storage and servers, desktop computers, and other hardware; and software products, such as cloud solutions, software assurance, application suites, security, virtualization, collaboration and productivity applications, operating systems, and network management. In addition, the company offers advisory and design, software development, implementation, and managed services, as well as warranties. It serves business, government, education, and healthcare customers. The company was formerly known as CDW Computer Centers, Inc. and changed its name to CDW Corporation in June 2003. CDW Corporation was founded in 1984 and is based in Vernon Hills, Illinois.","summary_zh":"CDW Corporation 在美國、英國和加拿大提供資訊科技 (IT) 解決方案。它透過三個部門運作：商業部門、政府部門和教育部門。該公司提供離散硬體和軟體產品及服務，以及整合 IT 解決方案，包括跨混合基礎設施、數位體驗和安全性的本地和雲端功能。它還提供硬體產品，包括筆記型電腦/行動裝置、平板電腦、網路通訊、協作硬體、資料儲存和伺服器、桌上型電腦和其他硬體；以及軟體產品，例如雲端解決方案、軟體保障、應用程式套件、安全性、虛擬化、協作和生產力應用程式、作業系統和網路管理。此外，該公司還提供諮詢和設計、軟體開發、實施、託管服務以及保固。它為企業、政府、教育和醫療保健客戶提供服務。該公司前身為 CDW Computer Centers, Inc.，並於 2003 年 6 月更名為 CDW Corporation。 CDW Corporation 成立於 1984 年，總部位於伊利諾州弗農希爾斯。","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"資訊科技服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":162.06,"h":163.87,"l":160.19,"c":162.27,"v":849300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":161.7,"h":163.7,"l":161.15,"c":163.37,"v":844300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":163.68,"h":166.75,"l":161.77,"c":166.25,"v":1198600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":166.96,"h":170.73,"l":165.64,"c":169.73,"v":1439000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":169.81,"h":169.97,"l":166.5,"c":167.85,"v":1194400},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":167.97,"h":169.51,"l":167.11,"c":168.95,"v":1085000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":167.93,"h":170.97,"l":167.1,"c":170.77,"v":1795900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":171.55,"h":171.55,"l":164.01,"c":165.73,"v":2039900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":165.05,"h":166.19,"l":163.93,"c":164.29,"v":1120700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":164.51,"h":167.05,"l":162.75,"c":163.13,"v":1289800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":163.89,"h":166.58,"l":162.59,"c":166.15,"v":1452600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":166.22,"h":169.2,"l":164.6,"c":167.29,"v":1244100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":168.57,"h":168.68,"l":161.99,"c":162.87,"v":2143700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":162.51,"h":163.32,"l":161.0,"c":161.22,"v":2889600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":161.01,"h":165.67,"l":160.74,"c":164.16,"v":1598700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":164.86,"h":165.74,"l":163.29,"c":164.58,"v":1252000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":164.04,"h":164.6,"l":159.32,"c":160.47,"v":2370800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":158.74,"h":159.07,"l":156.66,"c":156.97,"v":1682800},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":157.67,"h":164.76,"l":156.77,"c":164.37,"v":1497400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":166.06,"h":167.0,"l":162.05,"c":162.25,"v":1005300},{"t":"2025-09-30","